        omics data, implementing a three-step dimension reduction
        technique. A filter combined with the topological overlap
        measure first identifies the essential edges of the feature
        network, sparse hierarchical clustering then groups the
        selected features into modules, and each module is finally
        summarised by its first principal components. Subsequent
