        from genome-scale Perturb-seq differential-expression
        statistics by two stacked runs of preranked gene set enrichment
        analysis: once per perturbation over genes, then once per
        readout pathway over perturbations. Entry (j,k) of the
        resulting matrix measures whether perturbations targeting
        pathway j's members produce a coordinated transcriptional
