        positioning with high-throughput short-read data (MNase-Seq)
Description: This package detects nucleosome positions genome-wide from
        paired-end or single-end MNase-Seq reads using a Bayesian
        hierarchical model. Read positions are modelled as a mixture of
        Student's t-distributions with an informative
        Multinomial-Dirichlet prior on nucleosome locations, and the
        number of nucleosomes is estimated with a reversible jump
        Markov chain Monte Carlo (RJMCMC) algorithm. Functions are
        provided to split chromosomes into segments for parallel
